    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="structapi_1_1v2_1_1Types_1_1ClientData__t" kindref="compound">ClientData_t</ref> for updating a client: validates an update schema with a caller-supplied rule. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Unlike <ref refid="structapi_1_1v2_1_1Types_1_1CreateClient__t" kindref="compound">CreateClient_t</ref> it does not hash passwords; the validation rule is provided by the caller because different update endpoints permit different field sets. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
